hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1270","Ahmad ibn al-Miqdam al-Ijli narrated to us, Muhammad ibn Bakr narrated to us, Ibn Jurayj narrated to us, Abu al-Zubayr narrated to us, that he heard Jabir bin Abdullah said: I saw the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, while he was on his mount. He was praying voluntary prayers in every way, but he shortened The two prostrations of the two rak’ahs, and he nods.”"
